#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Bulk Walk Maximum Repetitions"
msgstr "Ku-celcelinta Ugu Badan ee Bulk Walk"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "For SNMPv2 and SNMPv3 Devices, the SNMP Bulk Walk max-repetitions size. The default is to 'Auto Detect on Re-Index'. For very large switches, high performance servers, Jumbo Frame Networks or for high latency WAN connections, increasing this value may increase poller performance. More data is packed into a single SNMP packet which can reduce data query run time. However, some devices may completely refuse to respond to packets with a max-repetition size which is set too large. This can be especially true for lower-powered IoT type devices or smaller embedded IT appliances. Special attention to the overall network path MTU should also be considered since setting a value which is too high could lead to packet fragmentation."
msgstr "Qalabka SNMPv2 iyo SNMPv3, cabbirka ku-celcelinta ugu badan ee SNMP Bulk Walk. Ka caadiga ah waa 'Si Toos ah u Ogaaw Marka Dib loo Tusmeeyo'. Beddelayaasha aadka u waaweyn, adeegayaasha waxqabadka sare leh, Shabakadaha Jumbo Frame ama xiriirrada WAN ee daahitaanka sare leh, kordhinta qiimahan waxay kordhin kartaa waxqabadka codbixiyaha. Xog badan ayaa lagu xiraa hal baakad oo SNMP ah taas oo yarayn karta waqtiga socodsiinta waydiinta xogta. Si kastaba ha ahaatee, qalabka qaar ayaa gebi ahaanba diidi kara inay ka jawaabaan baakadaha leh cabbir ku-celcelin ah oo aad u weyn. Tani waxay si gaar ah run ugu noqon kartaa qalabka nooca IoT ee tamarta yar ama qalabka yaryar ee IT ee ku dhex jira. Fiiro gaar ah waa in sidoo kale loo yeeshaa MTU-da guud ee marinka shabakadda maadaama dejinta qiime aad u sarreeya ay keeni karto kala-jabka baakadda."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Detect on Re-Index"
msgstr "Si Toos ah u Ogaaw Marka Dib loo Tusmeeyo"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Detect/Set on first Re-Index"
msgstr "Si Toos ah u Ogaaw/Deji Marka Dib loo Tusmeeyo ee Ugu Horreeya"

