msgid "How long can data be missing before RRDtool records unknown data.  Increase this value if your Data Source is unstable and you wish to carry forward old data rather than show gaps in your graphs.  This value is multiplied by the X-Files Factor to determine the actual amount of time."
msgstr "Intee in le'eg ayay xogtu maqnaan kartaa ka hor inta uusan RRDtool diiwaangelin xog aan la aqoon. Kordhi qiimahan haddii Isha Xogtaadu aanay degganayn oo aad rabto inaad horay u sii wadato xogtii hore halkii aad ka muujin lahayd daldaloolada garaafyadaada. Qiimahan waxaa lagu dhuftaa Qodobka X-Files si loo go'aamiyo muddada dhabta ah."

