msgid "Legend Options"
msgstr "Ikhtiyaarrada Furaha"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Padding"
msgstr "Buuxinta Otomaatigga ah"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Pad text so that legend and graph data always line up. Note: this could cause graphs to take longer to render because of the larger overhead. Also Auto Padding may not be accurate on all types of graphs, consistent labeling usually helps."
msgstr "Buuxi qoraalka si furaha iyo xogta garaafka ay had iyo jeer isugu toosnaadaan. Xusuusnow: tani waxay keeni kartaa in garaafyadu waqti dheer ku qaataan soo-bandhigidda culayska dheeraadka ah dartiis. Sidoo kale Buuxinta Otomaatigga ah waxaa laga yaabaa inaysan sax ku ahayn dhammaan noocyada garaafyada, calaamadeynta joogtada ahna badanaa way caawisaa."

