#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Show Form/Setting Help Inline"
msgstr "Muuji Caawimaadda Foomka/Dejinta Gudaha Bogga"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, Form and Setting Help will be show inline.  Otherwise it will be presented when hovering over the help button."
msgstr "Marka la calaamadiyo, Caawimaadda Foomka iyo Dejinta waxaa lagu muujin doonaa gudaha bogga. Haddii kale waxaa la soo bandhigi doonaa marka dul-istaago badhanka caawimaadda."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Page Help Only"
msgstr "Caawimaadda Bogga ee Gudaha Keliya"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default Cacti page help is located at docs.cacti.net.  However, if your system does not have access to the Internet, you may download the documentation locally in HTML format and host it in the 'docs' location of you Cacti server.  If you choose only to leverage the local location for page help documentation, check this checkbox."
msgstr "Sida caadiga ah caawimaadda bogga Cacti waxay ku taal docs.cacti.net. Si kastaba ha ahaatee, haddii nidaamkaagu aanu lahayn marin Internet, waxaad soo dejisan kartaa dukumeentiyada qaab HTML ah oo gudaha ah waxaadna ku martigelin kartaa goobta 'docs' ee server-kaaga Cacti. Haddii aad doorato inaad isticmaasho goobta gudaha oo keliya dukumeentiga caawimaadda bogga, calaamadee sanduuqan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Deletion Verification"
msgstr "Xaqiijinta Tirtiridda"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Prompt user before item deletion."
msgstr "Waydii isticmaalaha ka hor inta aan shayga la tirtirin."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Preservation Preset"
msgstr "Dejinta Hore ee Ilaalinta Isha Xogta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will set Radio Button to Delete related Data Sources of a Graph when removing Graphs.  Note: Cacti will not allow the removal of Data Sources if they are used in other Graphs."
msgstr "Marka la hawlgeliyo, Cacti wuxuu u dejin doonaa Badhanka Raadiyaha inuu Tirtiro Ilaha Xogta ee la xiriira Garaafka marka laga saarayo Garaafyada. Fiiro gaar ah: Cacti ma oggolaan doono in laga saaro Ilaha Xogta haddii lagu isticmaalo Garaafyo kale."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graphs Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Furitaanka Tooska ah ee Garaafyada"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will not lock Graphs.  This allow a faster manual modification of Data Sources related to a Graph."
msgstr "Marka la hawlgeliyo, Cacti ma qufuli doono Garaafyada. Tani waxay oggolaanaysaa wax ka beddel gacanta ah oo dhakhso leh oo lagu sameeyo Ilaha Xogta ee la xiriira Garaafka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hide Cacti Dashboard"
msgstr "Qari Dashboard-ka Cacti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "For use with Cacti's External Link Support.  Using this setting, you can hide the Cacti Dashboard, so you can display just your own page."
msgstr "Waxaa loo isticmaalaa Taageerada Xiriiriyaha Dibadda ee Cacti. Adigoo adeegsanaya dejintan, waxaad qarin kartaa Dashboard-ka Cacti, si aad u muujiso boggaaga gaarka ah oo keliya."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Drag-N-Drop"
msgstr "Hawlgeli Jiid-oo-Dhig"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Some of Cacti's interfaces support Drag-N-Drop.  If checked this option will be enabled.  Note: For visually impaired user, this option may be disabled."
msgstr "Qaar ka mid ah is-dhexgalka Cacti waxay taageeraan Jiid-oo-Dhig. Haddii la calaamadiyo ikhtiyaarkan waa la hawlgelin doonaa. Fiiro gaar ah: Isticmaalayaasha aragga naafada ka ah, ikhtiyaarkan waa la damin karaa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Site Security"
msgstr "Amniga Goobta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Connections over HTTPS"
msgstr "Ku Qasab Xiriirrada HTTPS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, any attempts to access Cacti will be redirected to HTTPS to ensure high security."
msgstr "Marka la calaamadiyo, isku day kasta oo lagu galo Cacti waxaa loo weecin doonaa HTTPS si loo xaqiijiyo amni sare."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Unsafe Remote Data Collector HTTPS"
msgstr "Oggolow Ururiyaha Xogta Fog ee HTTPS aan Ammaanka ahayn"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow the use of Self Signed Certificates and allow the hostname of the Certificate to differ from that of the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Oggolow isticmaalka Shahaadooyinka Is-saxiixay oo u oggolow magaca martigeliyaha (hostname) ee Shahaadada inuu ka duwanaado kan Ururiyaha Xogta Fog."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Unsafe Metacharacters in Data Input Methods"
msgstr "U Oggolow Astaamaha Gaarka ah (Metacharacters) ee aan Ammaanka ahayn Hababka Gelinta Xogta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Historically, Cacti administrators created simple Data Input Methods that include commands like \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" to represent a numeric value for use in Cacti Graphs.  In earlier versions of Cacti, this was permitted.  However, this is an unsafe practice as it is a gateway for third party users to publish insecure Data Templates.  In modern Cacti, these types of practices should be avoided.  However, we provide this option if you have older Data Input Methods that contain these unsafe Meta Characters and have not converted them to local scripts in the 'scripts' directory.  When this option is unchecked, Cacti restricts shell-style metacharacters such as quotation marks, curly brackets, vertical bars, backslashes, and backticks.  Cacti continues to allow greater-than and less-than signs for things like <path_cacti> and for input parameters, but if this option is unchecked, that is the limit of their permitted use."
msgstr "Taariikh ahaan, maamulayaasha Cacti waxay abuureen Hababka Gelinta Xogta oo fudud kuwaas oo ay ku jiraan amarro sida \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" si ay u matalaan qiime tiro ah oo loo isticmaalo Garaafyada Cacti.  Noocyadii hore ee Cacti, tani waa la oggolaa.  Si kastaba ha ahaatee, tani waa dhaqan aan ammaan ahayn maadaama ay u furto albaabka isticmaalayaasha saddexaad si ay u daabacaan Qaab-dhismeedyo Xogeed oo aan sugnayn.  Cacti casriga ah, dhaqamada noocan oo kale ah waa in laga fogaado.  Si kastaba ha ahaatee, waxaan bixinnaa ikhtiyaarkan haddii aad leedahay Hababka Gelinta Xogta oo duug ah oo ay ku jiraan Astaamaha Gaarka ah ee aan ammaanka ahayn isla markaana aadan u beddelin qoraallo maxalli ah oo ku jira galka 'scripts'.  Marka ikhtiyaarkan laga saaro calaamadda, Cacti wuxuu xaddidaa astaamaha gaarka ah ee qaabka shell sida calaamadaha xigashada, qaansooyinka qalloocan, baararka toosan, jiidaha gadaale, iyo backticks.  Cacti wuxuu sii wadaa inuu oggolaado calaamadaha ka-weyn iyo ka-yar ee waxyaabaha sida <path_cacti> iyo cabbirrada gelinta, laakiin haddii ikhtiyaarkan laga saaro calaamadda, taasi waa xadka isticmaalkooda la oggol yahay."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Script Policy"
msgstr "Siyaasadda Qoraalka ee Amniga Nuxurka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls the script-src CSP policy.  In Nonce Modes, Cacti Plugins that use inline JavaScript must include the nonce attribute from Cacti's builtin function 'CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()'. Otherwise, those scripts will be blocked by the browser.  Currently, Cacti only allows reporting on Cacti Plugins that do not properly use Nonce Mode.  In the future, we will allow Administrators to block such plugins from using their inline JavaScript if they are not using Nonces."
msgstr "Waxay maamushaa siyaasadda CSP ee script-src.  Qaababka Nonce, Barnaamijyada Ku-xiran ee Cacti (Plugins) ee isticmaala JavaScript-ka gudaha ku jira waa inay ku daraan sifooyinka nonce ee ka imanaya shaqada gudaha ee Cacti 'CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()'. Haddii kale, qoraalladaas waxaa xannibi doona birawsarka.  Hadda, Cacti wuxuu oggol yahay oo keliya ka warbixinta Barnaamijyada Ku-xiran ee Cacti ee aan si sax ah u isticmaalin Qaabka Nonce.  Mustaqbalka, waxaan u oggolaan doonnaa Maamulayaasha inay ka xannibaan barnaamijyada noocaas ah inay isticmaalaan JavaScript-kooda gudaha ku jira haddii aysan isticmaalayn Nonces."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "U Oggolow JavaScript-ka Gudaha ku jira ee aan lahayn Nonce"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow both unsafe-eval and Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "U Oggolow labadaba unsafe-eval iyo JavaScript-ka Gudaha ku jira ee aan lahayn Nonce"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Mode - Reporting Only"
msgstr "Qaabka Nonce - Warbixin Keliya"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "CSP Violation Report URI"
msgstr "URI-ga Warbixinta Xadgudubka CSP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use <url_path>/csp_report.php. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL-ka ay birawsarradu u soo diraan (POST) warbixinnada xadgudubka CSP ee qaababka nonce-report iyo nonce. U daa meel bannaan si aad u isticmaasho <url_path>/csp_report.php. Waa inuu ka kooban yahay oo keliya xarfo URL oo ammaan ah."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Alternate Sources"
msgstr "Ilaha Beddelka ah ee Content-Security"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Space delimited domain names that will be permitted to be accessed outside of the Web Server itself.  This is important for users choosing to use a CDN, or hosting site.  Sources can includes wildcards for example: *.mydomain.com, or a protocol, for example: https://*.example.com.  These Alternate Sources include Image, CSS and JavaScript types only."
msgstr "Magacyada domain-ka ee meel bannaan lagu kala sooco kuwaas oo loo oggolaan doono in laga galo meel ka baxsan Adeegaha Webka (Web Server) laftiisa. Tani waxay muhiim u tahay isticmaalayaasha doorta inay isticmaalaan CDN, ama goob martigelin (hosting site). Ilaha waxaa ku jiri kara astaamo guud (wildcards) tusaale ahaan: *.mydomain.com, ama borotokool, tusaale ahaan: https://*.example.com. Ilahan Beddelka ah waxay ku kooban yihiin noocyada Sawirka (Image), CSS iyo JavaScript oo keliya."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use /cacti/csp_report.php at the installation root. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL-ka ay biraawsarradu u diraan (POST) warbixinnada xadgudubka CSP ee qaababka nonce-report iyo nonce. Banaan ka tag si aad u isticmaasho /cacti/csp_report.php ee xididda rakibidda. Waa inuu ka koobnaadaa xarfo URL oo ammaan ah oo keliya."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Graph Creation"
msgstr "Daar Abuurista Jaantusyada ee Otomaatigga ah"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Marka la demiyo, Otomaatigga Cacti si firfircoon uma abuuri doono wax Jaantus ah. Tani waxay faa'iido leedahay marka la hagaajinayo dejimaha Qalabka si looga fogaado abuurista Jaantusyo cusub mar kasta oo aad kaydiso shay. U-yeerista Xeerarka Otomaatigga si gacanta ah weli way suurtagal ahaan doontaa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Tree Item Creation"
msgstr "Daar Abuurista Shayga Geedka ee Otomaatigga ah"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Tree Item.  This is useful when adjusting Device or Graph settings so as to avoid creating new Tree Entries each time you save an object.  Invoking Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Marka la demiyo, Otomaatigga Cacti si firfircoon uma abuuri doono wax Shay Geed ah. Tani waxay faa'iido leedahay marka la hagaajinayo dejimaha Qalabka ama Jaantuska si looga fogaado abuurista Gelitaanno Geed oo cusub mar kasta oo aad kaydiso shay. U-yeerista Xeerarka si gacanta ah weli way suurtagal ahaan doontaa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification To Email"
msgstr "Iimaylka Loo Diro Ogeysiinta Otomaatigga"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to send Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the Primary Cacti Admins Email account."
msgstr "Cinwaanka Iimaylka ee loo diro Iimayllada Ogeysiinta Otomaatigga haddii aan lagu cayimin heerka Shabakadda Otomaatigga. Haddii midkood goobtan, ama qiimaha Shabakadda Otomaatigga bannaanka loo daayo, Cacti wuxuu isticmaali doonaa koontada Iimaylka ee Maamulaha Koowaad ee Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Name"
msgstr "Magaca Diraha Ogeysiinta Otomaatigga"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Name to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Name."
msgstr "Magaca Iimaylka ee loo isticmaalo Iimayllada Ogeysiinta Otomaatigga haddii aan lagu cayimin heerka Shabakadda Otomaatigga. Haddii midkood goobtan, ama qiimaha Shabakadda Otomaatigga bannaanka loo daayo, Cacti wuxuu isticmaali doonaa Magaca Diraha ee caadiga ah ee nidaamka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Email"
msgstr "Iimaylka Diraha Ogeysiinta Otomaatigga"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Email Address."
msgstr "Cinwaanka Iimaylka ee loo adeegsado Iimaylada Ogeysiisyada Otomaatigga ah haddii aan lagu qeexin heerka Shabakadda Otomaatigga ah.  Haddii midkood goobtan, ama qiimaha Shabakadda Otomaatigga ah loo daayo bannaanaan, Cacti wuxuu adeegsan doonaa Cinwaanka Iimaylka ee Ka Yimid (From) ee caadiga ah ee nidaamka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Defaults"
msgstr "Qiyamka Caadiga ah ee Qaabka Garaafka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Test Data Source"
msgstr "Isha Xogta Tijaabada ee Qaabka Garaafka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation for new and newly imported Graph Templates.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "Calamaadi sanduuqan haddii aad rabto inaad tijaabiso Ilaha Xogta ka hor inta aan la samayn Qaababka Garaafka ee cusub iyo kuwa dhowaan la soo dejiyay.  Marka Ilaha Xogta Tijaabada la hawlgeliyo, haddii Isha Xogtu aysan soo celin xog sax ah, Garaafka lama samayn doono.  Dejintani waa muhiim haddii aad rabto inaad yeelato Qaab Aalad oo guud oo ku dari kara Qaabab Garaaf oo badan kuwaas oo si xulasho ah loo dabaqi karo iyadoo ku xiran sifooyinka Aaladda lafteeda.  Fiiro gaar ah: Haddii aad haysato qoraal (script) muddo dheer socda oo ah Isha Xogta, wakhtiga lagu sameeyo Garaafyada wuu kordhi doonaa."

