msgstr "Hab-maamuuska Asturnaanta (v3)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default SNMPv3 Privacy Protocol for all new Devices."
msgstr "Hab-maamuuska Asturnaanta SNMPv3 ee caadiga ah ee dhammaan Aaladaha cusub."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Privacy Passphrase (v3)"
msgstr "Weedha Sirta ah ee Asturnaanta (v3)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default SNMPv3 Privacy Passphrase for all new Devices."
msgstr "Weedha Sirta ah ee Asturnaanta SNMP v3 ee caadiga ah ee dhammaan Aaladaha cusub."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enter the SNMP v3 Context for all new Devices."
msgstr "Geli Nuxurka (Context) SNMP v3 ee dhammaan Aaladaha cusub."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default SNMP v3 Engine Id for all new Devices. Leave this field empty to use the SNMP Engine ID being defined per SNMPv3 Notification receiver."
msgstr "Aqoonsiga Mishiinka (Engine Id) ee SNMP v3 ee caadiga ah ee dhammaan Aaladaha cusub. Goobtan u daa mid bannaan si loo adeegsado Aqoonsiga Mishiinka SNMP ee lagu qeexay qaabilaha Ogeysiiska SNMPv3 kasta."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Port Number"
msgstr "Lambarka Port-ka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default UDP Port for all new Devices.  Typically 161."
msgstr "Port-ka UDP ee caadiga ah ee dhammaan Aaladaha cusub.  Badanaa waa 161."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default SNMP timeout in milli-seconds for all new Devices."
msgstr "Wakhtiga dhicitaanka SNMP ee caadiga ah ee milisekan dhammaan Aaladaha cusub."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default SNMP retries for all new Devices."
msgstr "Tirada isku-dayga ku-celinta SNMP ee caadiga ah ee dhammaan Aaladaha cusub."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Availability/Reachability"
msgstr "Helitaanka/Gaaritaanka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Availability/Reachability for all new Devices.  The method Cacti will use to determine if a Device is available for polling.  <br><i>NOTE: It is recommended that, at a minimum, SNMP always be selected.</i>"
msgstr "Helitaanka/Gaaritaanka caadiga ah ee dhammaan Aaladaha cusub. Habka uu Cacti u adeegsan doono inuu go'aamiyo haddii Aaladdu diyaar u tahay xog-qaadista. <br><i>OGOW: Waxaa lagu talinayaa in ugu yaraan had iyo jeer la doorto SNMP.</i>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Ping Type"
msgstr "Nooca Ping"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Ping type for all new Devices.</i>"
msgstr "Nooca Ping ee caadiga ah dhammaan Aaladaha cusub.</i>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Ping Port for all new Devices.  With TCP, Cacti will attempt to Syn the port.  With UDP, Cacti requires either a successful connection, or a 'port not reachable' error to determine if the Device is up or not."
msgstr "Dekedda Ping ee caadiga ah dhammaan Aaladaha cusub. Marka la adeegsanayo TCP, Cacti wuxuu isku dayi doonaa inuu Syn u diro dekedda. Marka la adeegsanayo UDP, Cacti wuxuu u baahan yahay midkood xiriir guulaysta, ama khalad 'port not reachable' ah si uu u go'aamiyo in Aaladdu shidan tahay iyo in kale."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Ping Timeout value in milli-seconds for all new Devices.  The timeout values to use for Device SNMP, ICMP, UDP and TCP pinging.  ICMP Pings will be rounded up to the nearest second.  TCP and UDP connection timeouts on Windows are controlled by the operating system, and are therefore not recommended on Windows."
msgstr "Qiimaha caadiga ah ee waqti-dhammaadka Ping oo ku cabbiran millisekan dhammaan Aaladaha cusub. Qiimayaasha waqti-dhammaadka ee loo adeegsado dirista Ping ee SNMP, ICMP, UDP iyo TCP ee Aaladda. Ping-yada ICMP waxaa loo wareejin doonaa ilbiriqsiga ugu dhow ee kore. Waqti-dhammaadyada xiriirka TCP iyo UDP ee Windows waxaa maamula nidaamka hawlgalka, sidaas darteed laguma talinayo Windows."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of times Cacti will attempt to ping a Device before marking it as down."
msgstr "Tirada jeer ee uu Cacti isku dayi doono inuu Ping u diro Aaladda ka hor inta aanu u calaamadin inay dansan tahay."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Up/Down Settings"
msgstr "Dejinta Xaaladda Shidan/Dansan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Failure Count"
msgstr "Tirada Fashilka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of polling intervals a Device must be down before logging an error and reporting Device as down."
msgstr "Tirada xilliyada xog-qaadista ee ay tahay in Aaladdu dansanaato ka hor inta aan khalad la diiwaangelin oo aan Aaladda looga warbixin inay dansan tahay."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Recovery Count"
msgstr "Tirada Soo-kabashada"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of polling intervals a Device must remain up before returning Device to an up status and issuing a notice."
msgstr "Tirada xilliyada xog-qaadista ee ay tahay in Aaladdu shidnaato ka hor inta aan Aaladda lagu celin xaaladda shidan oo aan ogeysiis la soo saarin."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Theme Settings"
msgstr "Dejinta Muuqaalka (Theme)"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
