msgstr "Muuqaalka (Theme)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Please select one of the available Themes to skin your Cacti with."
msgstr "Fadlan dooro mid ka mid ah Muuqaallada (Themes) diyaarka ah si aad ugu qurxiso Cacti-gaaga."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Table Settings"
msgstr "Dejinta Shaxda"

