msgid "Rows Per Page"
msgstr "Safafka Bog Kasta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of rows to display on for a table."
msgstr "Tirada caadiga ah ee safafka lagu soo bandhigayo shaxda."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Autocomplete Enabled"
msgstr "Buuxinta Tooska ah waa la Hawlgeliyay"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "In very large systems, select lists can slow the user interface significantly.  If this option is enabled, Cacti will use autocomplete callbacks to populate the select list systematically.  Note: autocomplete is forcibly disabled on the Classic theme."
msgstr "Nidaamyada aadka u waaweyn, liisaska xulashada waxay si weyn u gaabin karaan isdhexgalka isticmaalaha. Haddii ikhtiyaarkan la hawlgeliyo, Cacti wuxuu isticmaali doonaa wicitaannada dib-u-celinta ee buuxinta tooska ah (autocomplete callbacks) si uu liiska xulashada si nidaamsan ugu buuxiyo. Fiiro gaar ah: buuxinta tooska ah si khasab ah ayaa looga damiyay mawduuca Classic."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Select Search Minimum Rows"
msgstr "Dooro Safafka Ugu Yar ee Raadinta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The minimum number of options a dropdown must have before Cacti shows a search box inside it.  Choose 'Always' to show the search box regardless of the number of options."
msgstr "Tirada ugu yar ee xulashooyinka ay tahay in liis hoos-u-dhac ahi yeesho ka hor inta aanu Cacti gudihiisa ku muujin sanduuqa raadinta. Dooro 'Had iyo jeer' si aad u muujiso sanduuqa raadinta iyadoo aan loo eegin tirada xulashooyinka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Always"
msgstr "Had iyo jeer"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Autocomplete Rows"
msgstr "Safafka Dhammaystirka Tooska ah"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ".  This is limited by the php setting 'max_input_vars', currently:"
msgstr ".  Tani waxaa xaddidaya dejinta PHP ee 'max_input_vars', hadda waa:"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of rows to return from an autocomplete based select pattern match."
msgstr "Tirada caadiga ah ee safafka laga soo celinayo raadinta xulashada ku salaysan dhammaystirka tooska ah."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Minimum Tree Width"
msgstr "Ballaca Ugu Yar ee Geedka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Minimum width of the Tree to contract to."
msgstr "Ballaca Ugu Yar ee uu Geedku u yaraan karo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Tree Width"
msgstr "Ballaca Ugu Badan ee Geedka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Maximum width of the Tree to expand to, after which time, Tree branches will scroll on the page."
msgstr "Ballaca Ugu Badan ee uu Geedku u ballaaran karo, ka dib markaas oo laamaha Geedku ay ku dhex rogman doonaan bogga."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Site Graph Template Expansion"
msgstr "Ballaarinta Qaab-dhismeedka Jaantuska Goobta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When viewing Site Trees, should the Graph Templates branch be included as a Site sub-branch?"
msgstr "Marka la eegayo Geedaha Goobta (Site Trees), ma in laanta Qaab-dhismeedyada Jaantuska lagu daraa iyadoo ah laan-hoosaad Goob?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Filter Settings"
msgstr "Dejinta Shaandhaynta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Strip Domains from Device Dropdowns"
msgstr "Ka saar Magacyada Domain-ka Liisaska Aaladaha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When viewing Device name filter dropdowns, checking this option will strip to domain from the hostname."
msgstr "Marka la eegayo liisaska shaandhaynta magaca Aaladda, saxidda xulashadan waxay ka saari doontaa domain-ka magaca martigaliyaha."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph/Data Source/Data Query Settings"
msgstr "Dejinta Garaafka/Isha Xogta/Weydiinta Xogta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Title Length"
msgstr "Dhererka Ugu Badan ee Cinwaanka"

#: include/global_settings.php
