#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Log Viewer Settings"
msgstr "Dejinta Eegaha Diiwaanka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Exclusion Regex"
msgstr "Regex-ka Ka-reebidda"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Any strings that match this regex will be excluded from the user display.  <strong>For example, if you want to exclude all log lines that include the words 'Admin' or 'Login' you would type '(Admin || Login)'</strong>"
msgstr "Qoraal kasta oo ku habboon regex-kan waxaa laga saari doonaa muujinta adeegsadaha. <strong>Tusaale ahaan, haddii aad rabto inaad ka saarto dhammaan safafka diiwaanka ee ay ku jiraan ereyada 'Admin' ama 'Login' waxaad qori lahayd '(Admin || Login)'</strong>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Real-time Graphs"
msgstr "Garaafyada Waqtiga-dhabta ah"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Real-time Graphing"
msgstr "Daar Garaaf-samaynta Waqtiga-dhabta ah"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When an option is checked, users will be able to put Cacti into Real-time mode."
msgstr "Marka ikhtiyaar la calaamadeeyo, adeegsadayaashu waxay awood u yeelan doonaan inay Cacti geliyaan qaabka Waqtiga-dhabta ah."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This timespan you wish to see on the default graph."
msgstr "Mudadda waqtiga ee aad rabto inaad ku aragto garaafka caadiga ah."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Minimum Refresh Interval"
msgstr "Muddada Ugu Yar ee Cusboonaysiinta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the minimal supported time between Graph updates.  This value is also used to set certain RRDfile attributes.  If you have a Device that caches data and does not provide realtime updates, you may have to increase the default Minimum Refresh Interval to prevent creating Graphs with gaps."
msgstr "Tani waa waqtiga ugu yar ee la taageero ee u dhexeeya cusboonaysiinta Garaafka. Qiimahan waxaa sidoo kale loo isticmaalaa in lagu dejiyo sifooyinka qaarkood ee RRDfile. Haddii aad leedahay Qalab kaydiya xogta oo aan bixin cusboonaysiin waqtiga-dhabta ah, waxaa laga yaabaa inaad kordhiso Muddada Ugu Yar ee Cusboonaysiinta ee caadiga ah si aad uga hortagto abuurista Garaafyo leh meelo bannaan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cache Directory"
msgstr "Hagaha Kaydka (Cache)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the location, on the web server where the RRDfiles and PNG files will be cached.  This cache will be managed by the poller.  Make sure you have the correct read and write permissions on this folder"
msgstr "Tani waa goobta ku taal adeegaha webka ee lagu kaydin doono faylasha RRDfiles iyo PNG. Kaydkan waxaa maamuli doona poller-ka. Hubi inaad ku leedahay ogolaanshaha akhrinta iyo qorista ee saxda ah galkan"

#: include/global_settings.php
