msgstr "Farta loo isticmaalo Sharaxaadda Garaafka. Geli midkood fayl True Type Font ah oo sax ah ama qiime Pango font-config ah oo sax ah."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Axis Font Size"
msgstr "Cabbirka Farta Dhidibka (Axis)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The size of the font used for Graph Axis"
msgstr "Cabbirka farta loo isticmaalo Dhidibka Garaafka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Axis Font Setting"
msgstr "Dejinta Farta Dhidibka (Axis)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The font to use for Graph Axis items.  Enter either a valid True Type Font file or valid Pango font-config value."
msgstr "Farta loo isticmaalo walxaha Dhidibka Garaafka. Geli midkood fayl True Type Font ah oo sax ah ama qiime Pango font-config ah oo sax ah."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Unit Font Size"
msgstr "Cabbirka Farta Halbeegga"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The size of the font used for Graph Units"
msgstr "Cabbirka farta loo isticmaalo Halbeegyada Garaafka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Unit Font Setting"
msgstr "Dejinta Farta Halbeegga"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The font to use for Graph Unit items.  Enter either a valid True Type Font file or valid Pango font-config value."
msgstr "Farta loo isticmaalo walxaha Halbeegga Garaafka. Geli midkood fayl True Type Font ah oo sax ah ama qiime Pango font-config ah oo sax ah."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Business Hours Settings"
msgstr "Dejinta Saacadaha Shaqada"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Start of Business Day"
msgstr "Bilowga Maalinta Shaqada"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The time your business hours start. Format: hh:mm"
msgstr "Waqtiga ay bilaabmaan saacadaha shaqadaada. Qaabka: hh:mm"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "End of Business Day"
msgstr "Dhammaadka Maalinta Shaqada"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The time your business hours end. Format: hh:mm"
msgstr "Waqtiga ay dhammaadaan saacadaha shaqadaada. Qaabka: hh:mm"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hide Weekends"
msgstr "Qari Maalmaha Fasaxa Toddobaadka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Only show business hours during weekdays."
msgstr "Kaliya muuji saacadaha shaqada inta lagu jiro maalmaha shaqada ee toddobaadka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Show business hours"
msgstr "Muuji saacadaha shaqada"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Display business hours on rrd graphs."
msgstr "Ku soo bandhig saacadaha shaqada garaafyada RRD."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Color to use for business hours"
msgstr "Midabka loo isticmaalayo saacadaha shaqada"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The color to be shown for business hours"
msgstr "Midabka la muujinayo ee saacadaha shaqada"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum number of days to show business hours"
msgstr "Tirada ugu badan ee maalmaha la muujinayo saacadaha shaqada"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "After this number of days, the business hours will not be added to the graph. <br/>Recommended: 62 days"
msgstr "Tiradan maalmaha ah ka dib, saacadaha shaqada laguma dari doono garaafka. <br/>Waxaa lagu talinayaa: 62 maalmood"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collection Enabled"
msgstr "Ururinta Xogta Way Shidan Tahay"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you wish to stop the polling process completely, uncheck this box."
msgstr "Haddii aad rabto inaad gebi ahaanba joojiso habka xog-ururinta (polling), ka saar calaamadda sanduuqan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Type"
msgstr "Nooca Poller-ka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The poller type to use.  This setting will take affect at next polling interval."
msgstr "Nooca poller-ka ee la isticmaali doono. Dejintani waxay dhaqan geli doontaa muddada xog-ururinta ee xigta."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Sync Interval"
msgstr "Muddada Iswaafajinta Poller-ka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default polling sync interval to use when creating a poller.  This setting will affect how often remote pollers are checked and updated."
msgstr "Muddada iswaafajinta xog-ururinta ee caadiga ah ee la isticmaalo marka la abuurayo poller. Dejintani waxay saamayn doontaa inta jeer ee poller-rada fog la hubiyo oo la cusboonaysiiyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The polling interval in use.  This setting will affect how often RRDfiles are checked and updated.  <strong><u>NOTE: If you change this value, you must re-populate the poller cache.  Failure to do so, may result in lost data.</u></strong>"
msgstr "Muddada xog-ururinta ee la isticmaalayo. Dejintani waxay saamayn doontaa inta jeer ee faylasha RRDfiles la hubiyo oo la cusboonaysiiyo. <strong><u>FIIRO GAAR AH: Haddii aad beddesho qiimahan, waa inaad dib u buuxisaa kaydka poller-ka. Haddii aad sidaas samayn weydo, waxay keeni kartaa in xogtu lunto.</u></strong>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cron/Daemon Interval"
msgstr "Muddada Cron/Daemon"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The frequency that the Cacti data collector will be started.  You can use either crontab, a scheduled task (for windows), or the cactid systemd service to control launching the Cacti data collector.  For instructions on using the cactid daemon, review the README.md file in the service directory."
msgstr "Inta jeer ee la bilaabi doono xog-ururiyaha Cacti. Waxaad isticmaali kartaa midkood crontab, hawl qorshaysan (Windows), ama adeegga cactid systemd si aad u xakamayso bilaabista xog-ururiyaha Cacti. Tilmaamaha isticmaalka cactid daemon, dib u eeg faylka README.md ee ku jira galka service."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Balance Process Load"
msgstr "Isku-dheellitir Culayska Hawsha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will attempt to balance the load of each poller process by equally distributing poller items per process."
msgstr "Haddii aad doorato ikhtiyaarkan, Cacti wuxuu isku dayi doonaa inuu isku dheellitiro culayska hab kasta oo poller ah isagoo si siman u qaybinaya walxaha poller-ka habkiiba."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Debug Output Width"
msgstr "Ballaca Soo-saarka Cilad-bixinta (Debug)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will check for output that exceeds Cacti's ability to store it and issue a warning when it finds it."
msgstr "Haddii aad doorato ikhtiyaarkan, Cacti wuxuu hubin doonaa soo-saarka ka badnaada awoodda kaydinta ee Cacti wuxuuna soo saari doonaa digniin marka uu helo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent Timeout"
msgstr "Waqtiga Dhammaadka Wakiilka Fog (Remote Agent)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The amount of time, in seconds, that the Central Cacti web server will wait for a response from the Remote Data Collector to obtain various Device information before abandoning the request.  On Devices that are associated with Data Collectors other than the Central Cacti Data Collector, the Remote Agent must be used to gather Device information."
msgstr "Muddada waqtiga, ilbiriqsiyo ahaan, ee adeegaha shabakadda ee Cacti-ga Dhexe uu sugi doono jawaabta Ururiyaha Xogta ee Fog si loo helo macluumaad kala duwan oo Qalabka ah ka hor inta uusan ka tanaasulin codsiga. Qalabka ku xiran Ururiyeyaasha Xogta ee aan ahayn Ururiyaha Xogta ee Cacti-ga Dhexe, waa in la isticmaalo Wakiilka Fog si loo ururiyo macluumaadka Qalabka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Refresh Poller Table Per Cycle"
msgstr "Cusboonaysii Shaxda Poller-ka Wareeg Kasta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This setting is for a single poller systems only to rebuild the poller output table on each polling cycle to prevent the memory table from swapping on very large systems with large databases that could use swap."
msgstr "Dejintani waxaa loogu talagalay nidaamyada leh hal poller oo keliya si dib loogu dhiso shaxda soo-saarka poller-ka wareeg kasta oo xog-ururin ah si looga hortago in shaxda xusuustu (memory table) ay isticmaasho swap nidaamyada aadka u waaweyn ee leh kayd xog waaweyn oo isticmaali kara swap."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Resource Cache Replication"
msgstr "Dami Nuqul-samaynta Kaydka Kheyraadka (Resource Cache)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, the main Cacti Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Cacti Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "Sida caadiga ah, Ururiyaha Xogta ee ugu weyn ee Cacti wuxuu dhammaan degelka webka iyo ku-xirayaasha ku kaydin doonaa Kaydka Kheyraadka (Resource Cache). Kadib, marba mar Ururiyeyaasha Xogta ee Fog waxay isku cusboonaysiin doonaan wixii cusboonaysiin ah ee ka yimaada Ururiyaha Xogta ee ugu weyn ee Cacti. Kaydkan Kheyraadku wuxuu asal ahaan u oggolaanayaa Ururiyeyaasha Xogta ee Fog inay iskood isu casriyeeyaan. Haddii aadan rabin inaad isticmaasho ikhtiyaarkan, waxaad ka damin kartaa adigoo isticmaalaya dejintan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Behavior"
msgstr "Dhaqanka SNMP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Agent Support Enabled"
msgstr "Taageerada Wakiilka SNMP waa la Hawlgeliyay"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this option is checked, Cacti will populate SNMP Agent tables with Cacti device and system information.  It does not enable the SNMP Agent itself."
msgstr "Haddii ikhtiyaarkan la calaamadiyo, Cacti wuxuu ku buuxin doonaa shaxda Wakiilka SNMP macluumaadka aaladda iyo nidaamka Cacti.  Ma hawlgeliso Wakiilka SNMP laftiisa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable MD5 and DES for SNMPv3"
msgstr "Hawlgeli MD5 iyo DES ee SNMPv3"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The MD5 authentication and DES privacy algorithms are legacy, weak, and unavailable on hardened (FIPS) PHP and Net-SNMP builds.  When disabled, MD5 and DES are removed from the SNMPv3 Authentication and Privacy Protocol dropdowns shown when editing a Device and in the Automation SNMP Options, leaving only the stronger SHA and AES algorithms."
msgstr "Qaacidooyinka xaqiijinta MD5 iyo asturnaanta DES waa kuwo duug ah, daciif ah, oo aan laga heli karin dhismayaasha adag (FIPS) ee PHP iyo Net-SNMP.  Marka la naafeeyo, MD5 iyo DES waa laga saaraa liisaska hoos-u-dhaca ee Hab-maamuuska Xaqiijinta iyo Asturnaanta SNMPv3 ee la muujiyo marka wax laga beddelayo Aalad iyo Ikhtiyaarrada SNMP ee Otomaatigga ah, iyadoo laga tagayo oo keliya qaacidooyinka xooggan ee SHA iyo AES."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Credential Cache"
msgstr "Hawlgeli Kaydka Aqoonsiga (Credential Cache)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Pre-harden and cache SNMPv3 credential arguments once per credential change so each poller process reuses them instead of rebuilding them on every request.  This yields a marginal savings when collecting with SNMPv3 credentials through the Net-SNMP binaries.  The php-snmp extension handles most SNMPv3 gets in-process and bypasses this cache, but the Net-SNMP binaries (and therefore this cache) are still used for SNMP walks, hex output, requests that set a context or engine id, and protocol combinations that the running PHP version does not support.  Enable this if you collect any of those workloads with SNMPv3 credentials."
msgstr "Horay u adkee oo kaydi doodooyinka aqoonsiga SNMPv3 hal mar isbeddel aqoonsi kasta si hab kasta oo poller ah uu dib ugu adeegsado halkii uu ka dib-u-dhisi lahaa codsi kasta.  Tani waxay keentaa kayd yar marka wax lagu ururinayo aqoonsiyada SNMPv3 iyada oo loo marayo faylasha fulinta ee Net-SNMP.  Kordhinta php-snmp waxay maamushaa inta badan helitaannada SNMPv3 habka gudahiisa waxayna dhaaftaa kaydkan, laakiin faylasha fulinta ee Net-SNMP (iyo sidaas darteed kaydkan) waxaa weli loo adeegsadaa socodka SNMP (walks), soo-saarka hex, codsiyada dejiya nuxurka (context) ama aqoonsiga mishiinka (engine id), iyo isku-darka hab-maamuusyada uusan taageerin nooca PHP ee shaqaynaya.  Hawlgeli tan haddii aad ururiso mid ka mid ah hawlahaas adigoo adeegsanaya aqoonsiyada SNMPv3."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Get OID Limit"
msgstr "Xadka SNMP Get OID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default maximum number of SNMP Get OIDs to issue per snmpget request.  For Devices, this setting is controlled at the Device level.  You should only use this setting when using Cacti's SNMP API natively in your scripts or plugins."
msgstr "Tirada ugu badan ee caadiga ah ee SNMP Get OIDs ee la soo saaro codsi snmpget kasta.  Aaladaha, dejintan waxaa laga maamulaa heerka Aaladda.  Waa inaad adeegsataa dejintan oo keliya marka aad si dabiici ah ugu adeegsanayso API-ga SNMP ee Cacti qoraalladaada (scripts) ama plugins-kaaga."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Bulkwalk Fetch Size"
msgstr "Cabbirka Soo-qaadista SNMP Bulkwalk"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How many OID's should be returned per snmpbulkwalk request?  For Devices with large SNMP trees, increasing this size will increase re-index performance over a WAN."
msgstr "Immisa OID ayaa lagu soo celinayaa codsi kasta oo snmpbulkwalk ah? Aaladaha leh geedaha SNMP ee waaweyn, kordhinta cabbirkan waxay kordhin doontaa waxqabadka dib-u-tusmaynta ee shabakadda WAN."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable increasing OID Check"
msgstr "Jooji hubinta kordhinta OID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls disabling check for increasing OID while walking OID tree."
msgstr "Waxay maamushaa joojinta hubinta kordhinta OID inta lagu jiro socodka geedka OID."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Additional Data Collector Settings"
msgstr "Dejinta Dheeraadka ah ee Ururiyaha Xogta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Invalid Data Logging"
msgstr "Diiwaangelinta Xogta Aan Saxda Ahayn"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How would you like the Data Collector output errors logged?  Options include: 'Detailed' which details every error, 'Summary' which provides the number of output errors per Device, and 'None', which does not provide error counts."
msgstr "Sidee ayaad jeclaan lahayd in loo diiwaangeliyo khaladaadka ka soo baxa Ururiyaha Xogta? Ikhtiyaarrada waxaa ka mid ah: 'Faahfaahsan' oo faahfaahinaya khalad kasta, 'Kooban' oo bixinaya tirada khaladaadka soo saarista ee Qalabkiiba, iyo 'Waxba', oo aan bixinaynin tirada khaladaadka."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Kooban"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "Faahfaahsan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of PHP Script Servers"
msgstr "Tirada Adeegayaasha Script-ka PHP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Tirada hawlaha adeegaha script-ka ee isku mar soconaya hal hawl oo spine ahba. Dejinta u dhaxaysa 1 ilaa 15 ayaa la aqbalaa. Halbeeggan wuxuu ku caawinayaa haddii aad socodsiinayso dhowr dunood (threads) iyo script-yo adeegaha script-ka ah, wuxuuna u shaqeeyaa oo keliya Ururiyaha Xogta ee spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Script and Script Server Timeout Value"
msgstr "Qiimaha Waqti-dhammaadka Script-ka iyo Adeegaha Script-ka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Waqtiga ugu badan ee spine uu sugi doono in qoraalka (script) uu dhammaado. Qiimahan waqtiga dhammaadka wuxuu ku cabbiran yahay ilbiriqsiyo wuxuuna u shaqeeyaa oo keliya Ururiyaha Xogta ee spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Periodic All Device Re-Index"
msgstr "Dib-u-tusmaynta Joogtada ah ee Dhammaan Qalabka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Re-Index All Device Schedule"
msgstr "Jadwalka Dib-u-tusmaynta Dhammaan Qalabka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "At what frequency do you wish to Re-Index all Devices.  This Re-Index will occur at midnight at the frequency that you select."
msgstr "Intee jeer ayaad rabtaa in Dib-u-tusmayn lagu sameeyo dhammaan Qalabka. Dib-u-tusmayntani waxay dhici doontaa saqda dhexe iyadoo loo eegayo inta jeer ee aad doorato."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Weekly on Sunday"
msgstr "Toddobaadle Maalinta Axadda"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Monthly on Sunady"
msgstr "Bishiiba mar maalinta Axadda"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Background Timeout and Concurrent Process Settings"
msgstr "Dejinta Waqtiga Dhammaadka ee Gadaasha (Background) iyo Hawlaha Isbarbar-socda"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Report Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Waqtiga Dhammaadka ee Soo-saarista Warbixinta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Reports Generation script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Waqtiga ugu badan ee qoraalka (script) Soo-saarista Warbixinnada ee Cacti uu socon karo isagoon dhalin khalad waqti-dhammaad ah lana joojin."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Minute"
msgstr "%s Daqiiqo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Statistics Timeout"
msgstr "Waqti-dhammaadka Tirokoobka Isha Xogta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Data Source Statistics script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Waqtiga ugu badan ee script-ka Tirokoobka Isha Xogta ee Cacti uu shaqayn karo iyadoo aan dhalin khalad waqti-dhammaad ah laguna joojin."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDChecker Timeout"
msgstr "Waqti-dhammaadka RRDChecker"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's RRDfile check script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Waqtiga ugu badan ee qoraalka (script) hubinta RRDfile ee Cacti uu socon karo isagoon dhalin khalad waqti-dhammaad ah lana joojin."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Hour"
msgstr "%s Saac"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Commands Timeout"
msgstr "Waqti-dhammaadka Amarrada Poller-ka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Background Commands script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed.  This script will perform tasks such as re-indexing Devices and pruning devices from Remote Data Collectors."
msgstr "Waqtiga ugu badan ee script-ka Amarrada Dambe ee Cacti uu shaqayn karo iyadoo aan dhalin khalad waqti-dhammaad ah laguna joojin. Script-kani wuxuu qaban doonaa hawlo ay ka mid yihiin dib-u-tusmaynta Qalabka iyo ka-saarista qalabka Ururiyeyaasha Xogta ee Fog."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Command Concurrent Processes"
msgstr "Hawlaha Isku Mar Socda ee Amarka Poller-ka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent Poller Command processes.  The will be at most one concurrent command per host within the Poller Command pool."
msgstr "Tirada hawlaha isku mar socda ee Amarka Poller-ka. Waxaa jiri doona ugu badnaan hal amar oo isku mar socda martigeliye kasta gudaha barkadda Amarka Poller-ka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Process"
msgstr "1 Hawl"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Processes"
msgstr "%d Hawlo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Waqti-dhammaadka Abuurista Dambe ee Dayactirka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Cacti's Maintenance script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Waqtiga ugu badan ee script-ka Dayactirka ee Cacti uu shaqayn karo iyadoo aan dhalin khalad waqti-dhammaad ah laguna joojin."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spikekill Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Waqti-dhammaadka Abuurista Dambe ee Spikekill"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Cacti's Spikekill script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Waqtiga ugu badan ee script-ka Spikekill ee Cacti uu shaqayn karo iyadoo aan dhalin khalad waqti-dhammaad ah laguna joojin."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Defaults"
msgstr "Qiimayaasha Caadiga ah ee Ururiyaha Xogta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "These settings are maintained at the Data Collector level.  The values here are only defaults used when first creating a Data Collector."
msgstr "Dejintan waxaa lagu hayaa heerka Ururiyaha Xogta. Qiimayaasha halkan ku jira waa kuwo caadi ah oo la isticmaalo marka ugu horreysa ee la abuurayo Ururiye Xog."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Processes"
msgstr "Hawlaha Ururiyaha Xogta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of concurrent processes to execute per Data Collector.  NOTE: Starting from Cacti 1.2, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector.  Moving forward, this value is only a preset for the Data Collector.  Using a higher number when using cmd.php will improve performance.  Performance improvements in Spine are best resolved with the threads parameter.  When using Spine, we recommend a lower number and leveraging threads instead.  When using cmd.php, use no more than 2x the number of CPU cores."
msgstr "Tirada caadiga ah ee hawlaha isbarbar-socda ee la fulinayo Ururiye Xog kasta. FIIRO GAAR AH: Laga bilaabo Cacti 1.2, dejintan waxaa lagu hayaa Ururiyaha Xogta. Wixii hadda ka dambeeya, qiimahani waa kaliya dejin horay loo sii diyaariyay oo loogu talagalay Ururiyaha Xogta. Isticmaalka tiro ka badan marka la isticmaalayo cmd.php waxay wanaajin doontaa waxqabadka. Hagaajinta waxqabadka ee Spine waxaa ugu fiican in lagu xalliyo cabbirka dunaha (threads). Marka la isticmaalayo Spine, waxaan ku talineynaa tiro yar oo taa beddelkeeda la adeegsado threads. Marka la isticmaalayo cmd.php, ha isticmaalin wax ka badan 2x tirada xudunta CPU."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Threads per Process"
msgstr "Dunaha (Threads) Hawl kasta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Default Threads allowed per process.  NOTE: Starting in Cacti 1.2+, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector, and this is simply the Preset.  Using a higher number when using Spine will improve performance.  However, ensure that you have enough MySQL/MariaDB connections to support the following equation: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  You must also ensure that you have enough spare connections for user login connections as well."
msgstr "Dunaha (Threads) Caadiga ah ee loo oggol yahay hawl kasta. FIIRO GAAR AH: Laga bilaabo Cacti 1.2+, dejintan waxaa lagu hayaa Ururiyaha Xogta, tanina waa kaliya Dejinta Horay Loo Diyaariyay. Isticmaalka tiro ka badan marka la isticmaalayo Spine waxay wanaajin doontaa waxqabadka. Si kastaba ha ahaatee, hubi inaad haysato xiriirro MySQL/MariaDB oo ku filan oo taageeraya isla'egtan: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers). Waa inaad sidoo kale hubisaa inaad haysato xiriirro dheeraad ah oo ku filan xiriirrada gelitaanka isticmaalaha sidoo kale."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Authentication Method"
msgstr "Habka Xaqiijinta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Cacti handles user authentication, which allows you to create users and give them rights to different areas within Cacti.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Authentication is handled by the web server. Users can be added or created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Allows for authentication against a LDAP server. Users will be created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.  If PHPs LDAP module is not enabled, LDAP Authentication will not appear as a selectable option.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Allows administrators to support multiple disparate groups from different LDAP/AD directories to access Cacti resources.  Just as LDAP Authentication, the PHP LDAP module is required to utilize this method.</blockquote>"
msgstr "<blockquote><i>Xaqiijinta Ku-dhisan</i> - Cacti ayaa maamula xaqiijinta isticmaalaha, taasoo kuu ogolaanaysa inaad abuurto isticmaalayaal oo aad siiso xuquuqaha meelo kala duwan oo ka mid ah Cacti.<br><br><i>Xaqiijinta Aasaasiga ah ee Webka</i> - Xaqiijinta waxaa maamula adeegaha webka. Isticmaalayaasha waa lagu dari karaa ama si toos ah ayaa loo abuuri karaa marka ugu horreysa ee ay soo galaan haddii Isticmaalaha Qaab-dhismeedka la qeexay, haddii kale waxaa la adeegsan doonaa ogolaanshaha martida ee la qeexay.<br><br><i>Xaqiijinta LDAP</i> - Waxay ogolaataa xaqiijinta ka dhanka ah adeegaha LDAP. Isticmaalayaasha si toos ah ayaa loo abuuri doonaa marka ugu horreysa ee ay soo galaan haddii Isticmaalaha Qaab-dhismeedka la qeexay, haddii kale waxaa la adeegsan doonaa ogolaanshaha martida ee la qeexay. Haddii qaybta LDAP ee PHP aan la hawlgelin, Xaqiijinta LDAP kama soo muuqan doonto ikhtiyaar la dooran karo.<br><br><i>Xaqiijinta Dhowr Domain oo LDAP/AD ah</i> - Waxay u ogolaataa maamulayaasha inay taageeraan kooxo kala duwan oo ka socda diiwaannada LDAP/AD ee kala duwan si ay u galaan kheyraadka Cacti. Sida Xaqiijinta LDAP oo kale, qaybta PHP LDAP ayaa loo baahan yahay si loo adeegsado habkan.</blockquote>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Support Authentication Cookies"
msgstr "Taageer Kukiyada Xaqiijinta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If a user authenticates and selects 'Keep me signed in', an authentication cookie will be created on the user's computer allowing that user to stay logged in.  The authentication cookie expires after 90 days of non-use."
msgstr "Haddii isticmaale uu xaqiijiyo aqoonsigiisa oo uu doorto 'Igu hay aniga oo ku jira', cookie-ga xaqiijinta ayaa lagu abuuri doonaa kombiyuutarka isticmaalaha taas oo u oggolaanaysa isticmaalahaas inuu ku sii jiro. Cookie-ga xaqiijintu wuxuu dhacayaa ka dib 90 maalmood oo aan la isticmaalin."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Special Users"
msgstr "Isticmaalayaasha Gaarka ah"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Primary Admin"
msgstr "Maamulaha Koowaad"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the primary administrative account that will automatically receive Emails when the Cacti system experiences issues.  To receive these Emails, ensure that your mail settings are correct, and the administrative account has an Email address that is set."
msgstr "Magaca koontada maamulka koowaad ee si toos ah u heli doonta iimeellada marka nidaamka Cacti uu la kulmo dhibaatooyin. Si aad u hesho iimeelladan, hubi in dejintaada boostadu ay sax tahay, iyo in koontada maamulku ay leedahay ciwaan iimeel oo la dejiyay."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "No User"
msgstr "Ma Jiro Isticmaale"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Guest User"
msgstr "Isticmaalaha Martida ah"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the guest user for viewing graphs; is 'No User' by default."
msgstr "Magaca isticmaalaha martida ah ee daawashada garaafyada; sida caadiga ah waa 'Ma Jiro Isticmaale'."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "User Template"
msgstr "Qaab-dhismeedka Isticmaalaha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the user that Cacti will use as a template for new Web Basic and LDAP users; is 'guest' by default.  This user account will be disabled from logging in upon being selected."
msgstr "Magaca isticmaalaha uu Cacti u adeegsan doono qaab-dhismeed ahaan isticmaalayaasha cusub ee Web Basic iyo LDAP; sida caadiga ah waa 'guest'. Koontadan isticmaale waa laga joojin doonaa inay soo gasho marka la doorto."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Authentication Settings"
msgstr "Dejinta Xaqiijinta Aasaasiga ah"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Auth Login Failure Message"
msgstr "Fariinta Fashilka Gelitaanka Xaqiijinta Aasaasiga ah"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if there are issues mapping the username to a valid Cacti account, the message included here will be displayed to users.  It can include both text and HTML."
msgstr "Marka la adeegsanayo xaqiijinta aasaasiga ah, haddii ay jiraan dhibaatooyin ku saabsan ku xiridda magaca isticmaalaha koonto Cacti ah oo ansax ah, fariinta halkan ku jirta ayaa loo soo bandhigi doonaa isticmaalayaasha. Waxay ku jiri kartaa qoraal iyo HTML labadaba."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Auth Mapfile"
msgstr "Faylka Khariidaynta Xaqiijinta Aasaasiga ah"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if the basic account needs to be translated to a different login account, you can specify a CSV file here to map the basic account to the desired login account."
msgstr "Marka la adeegsanayo xaqiijinta aasaasiga ah, haddii koontada aasaasiga ah ay u baahan tahay in loo beddelo koonto gelitaan oo kale, waxaad halkan ku cayimi kartaa fayl CSV ah si aad koontada aasaasiga ah ugu khariidayso koontada gelitaanka ee la rabo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Account Complexity Requirements"
msgstr "Shuruudaha Adkaanta Koontada Maxalliga ah"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Minimum Length"
msgstr "Dhererka Ugu Yar"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is minimal length of allowed passwords."
msgstr "Tani waa dhererka ugu yar ee erayada sirta ah ee la oggol yahay."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Mix Case"
msgstr "U Baahan Xarfo Waaweyn iyo Yaryar"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contains both lower and upper-case characters."
msgstr "Tani waxay u baahan doontaa in erayada sirta ah ee cusub ay ku jiraan xarfo yaryar iyo xarfo waaweyn labadaba."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Number"
msgstr "U Baahan Tiro"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 numerical character."
msgstr "Tani waxay u baahan doontaa in erayada sirta ah ee cusub ay ku jiraan ugu yaraan 1 lambar."

#: include/global_settings.php
