#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "A space delimited list of DNS hostnames or IP addresses for valid LDAP servers.  Cacti will attempt to use the LDAP servers from left to right to authenticate a user.<br><br>For One-Time Password (OTP/MFA) logins, do not use a space delimited multi-server list.  On a failed bind Cacti advances to the next server and re-binds with the same credentials, and the already-consumed one-time code will be rejected.  Instead enter a single, resilient DNS name fronted by a DNS load balancer (VIP) so that server failover is handled below Cacti and only one authentication bind is ever performed."
msgstr "Liis ay kala soocdo meel bannaan oo ka kooban magacyada martigeliyeyaasha DNS ama ciwaannada IP ee adeegayaasha LDAP ee saxda ah. Cacti waxay isku dayi doontaa inay adeegsato adeegayaasha LDAP min bidix ilaa midig si ay u xaqiijiso isticmaalaha.<br><br>Gelitaanka Erayga Sirta ah ee Hal-Mar ah (OTP/MFA), ha isticmaalin liis adeegayaal badan leh oo meel bannaan lagu kala soocay. Haddii xiritaanku (bind) fashilmo, Cacti waxay u gudubtaa adeegaha xiga waxayna mar kale ku xirataa isla aqoonsiga, koodhka hal-mar ah ee horay loo isticmaalayna waa la diidi doonaa. Taas beddelkeeda, geli hal magac oo DNS ah oo adkaysi leh kaas oo uu hor yaallo isku-dheellitiraha culeyska DNS (VIP) si beddelka adeegaha loogu maamulo meel ka hooseysa Cacti isla markaana hal xiritaan oo xaqiijin ah oo keliya la sameeyo."

