msgstr "Xaddiga ugu badan ee xusuusta ee Cacti Poller iyo Boost Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum RRD Update Script Run Time"
msgstr "Waqtiga Ugu Badan ee Socodka Qoraalka Cusboonaysiinta RRD"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost poller exceeds this runtime, a warning will be placed in the cacti log,"
msgstr "Haddii Boost poller-ku ka bato waqtigan socodka, digniin ayaa lagu qori doonaa diiwaanka Cacti,"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Failed RRDs Queued"
msgstr "Tirada Ugu Badan ee RRD-yada Fashilmay ee Safka ku Jira"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum number of RRD destinations retained for automatic Boost retry. Only the latest complete failed update is retained per destination."
msgstr "Tirada ugu badan ee meelaha loo socdo ee RRD ee loo hayo isku-dayga dib-u-cusbooneysiinta tooska ah ee Boost. Kaliya cusbooneysiintii ugu dambeysay ee dhammaystiran ee fashilantay ayaa loo hayaa meel kasta oo loo socdo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Failed RRD Retry Budget"
msgstr "Qoondada Isku-dayga Dib-u-celinta RRD ee Fashilmay"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum queued RRD destinations retried by one scheduled Boost run."
msgstr "Tirada ugu badan ee meelaha loo socdo ee RRD ee safka ku jira oo dib loogu dayayo hal mar oo Boost ah oo qorsheysan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Failed RRD Retries"
msgstr "Tirada Ugu Badan ee Isku-dayga RRD ee Fashilmay"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Queued RRD updates are explicitly discarded after this many failed automatic attempts."
msgstr "Cusbooneysiinta RRD ee safka ku jirta si cad ayaa loo tuuraa ka dib tiradan oo isku-dayo toos ah oo fashilmay ah."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Failed RRD Age"
msgstr "Da'da Ugu Badan ee RRD ee Fashilmay"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Days to retain the latest failed RRD update before explicit discard."
msgstr "Maalmaha la haynayo cusbooneysiintii ugu dambeysay ee RRD ee fashilantay ka hor inta aan si cad loo tuurin."

