msgid "Enable Structured Paths"
msgstr "Daar Dariiqyada Habaysan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Use a separate subfolder for each hosts RRD files.  The naming of the RRDfiles will be one of the following:<br><ul><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/host_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd.</li></ul><br>You can make this change after install by running the CLI script <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> after you make the change.  NOTE: If you change Max Directories value to decrease the number of directories, or if you change the Directory Pattern, empty directories will not be pruned after you rerun the <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> script."
msgstr "U isticmaal gal-hoosaad gooni ah faylasha RRD ee martigeliye kasta. Magacaabista RRDfiles waxay noqon doontaa mid ka mid ah kuwan soo socda:<br><ul><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/host_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd.</li></ul><br>Isbeddelkan waxaad samayn kartaa rakibidda ka dib adigoo socodsiinaya qoraalka CLI ee <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> ka dib marka aad isbeddelka samayso. FIIRO GAAR AH: Haddii aad beddesho qiimaha Ugu Badnaan Galka si aad u yarayso tirada gallada, ama haddii aad beddesho Qaabka Galka, gallada madhan lama tirtiri doono ka dib marka aad dib u socodsiiso qoraalka <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b>."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Directory Pattern"
msgstr "Qaabka Galka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Which Directory Pattern do you wish to use for Structured RRD Paths.  'Device ID' is the default.  The setting 'Device ID/Data Query ID' should be used when you have Devices with thousands of Graphs.  After Changing the Directory Pattern, you must run the Structured Path CLI script again to modify the RRDfile paths to the new Pattern."
msgstr "Qaabka Galka ee aad rabto inaad u isticmaasho Dariiqyada RRD ee Habaysan. 'Aqoonsiga Qalabka' waa kan caadiga ah. Dejinta 'Aqoonsiga Qalabka/Aqoonsiga Weydiinta Xogta' waa in la isticmaalaa marka aad leedahay Qalabyo leh kumanaan Jaantusyo ah. Ka dib markaad beddesho Qaabka Galka, waa inaad mar kale socodsiisaa qoraalka CLI ee Dariiqa Habaysan si aad u beddesho dariiqyada RRDfile una dhigto Qaabka cusub."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device ID"
msgstr "Aqoonsiga Qalabka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device ID/Data Query ID"
msgstr "Aqoonsiga Qalabka/Aqoonsiga Weydiinta Xogta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Hash/Device ID"
msgstr "Hash-ka Qalabka/Aqoonsiga Qalabka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Hash/Device ID/Data Query ID"
msgstr "Hash-ka Qalabka/Aqoonsiga Qalabka/Aqoonsiga Weydiinta Xogta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Max Device Hash Directories"
msgstr "Tirada Ugu Badan ee Gallada Hash-ka Qalabka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum number of Device Directories to be created based upon hashed Device ID's."
msgstr "Tirada ugu badan ee Gallada Qalabka ee la abuurayo iyadoo lagu salaynayo Aqoonsiyada Qalabka ee hash lagu sameeyay."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Proxy Server"
msgstr "Adeegaha Wakiilka (Proxy)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The DNS hostname or IP address of the RRDtool proxy server."
msgstr "Magaca martigeliyaha DNS ama ciwaanka IP ee adeegaha wakiilka (proxy) ee RRDtool."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Proxy Port Number"
msgstr "Lambarka Dekedda (Port) ee Wakiilka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for encrypted communication."
msgstr "Dekedda (port) TCP ee isgaarsiinta siraysan."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "RSA Fingerprint"
msgstr "Faraha RSA (Fingerprint)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the proxy is using. This is required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "Faraha (fingerprint) furaha guud ee RSA ee hadda uu wakiilku isticmaalayo. Tani waxay lagama maarmaan u tahay samaynta xiriir la aamini karo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDtool Proxy Server - Backup"
msgstr "Adeegaha Wakiilka (Proxy) ee RRDtool - Kaydka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Load Balancing"
msgstr "Dheellitirka Culayska"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If both main and backup proxy are receivable this option allows to spread all requests against RRDtool."
msgstr "Haddii labada wakiil ee ugu weyn iyo kan kaydka ahba la heli karo, ikhtiyaarkan wuxuu oggolaanayaa in dhammaan codsiyada RRDtool loo qaybiyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The DNS hostname or IP address of the RRDtool backup proxy server if proxy is running in MSR mode."
msgstr "Magaca martigeliyaha DNS ama ciwaanka IP ee adeegaha wakiilka (proxy) ee kaydka RRDtool haddii wakiilku ku shaqaynayo qaabka MSR."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for encrypted communication with the backup proxy."
msgstr "Dekedda (port) TCP ee isgaarsiinta siraysan ee lala yeesho wakiilka kaydka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the backup proxy is using. This required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "Faraha (fingerprint) furaha guud ee RSA ee hadda uu isticmaalayo wakiilka kaydku. Tani waxay lagama maarmaan u tahay samaynta xiriir la aamini karo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spike Kill Settings"
msgstr "Dejinta Joojinta Sarakaca (Spike Kill)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Removal Method"
msgstr "Habka Ka-saarista"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are two removal methods.  The first, Standard Deviation, will remove any sample that is X number of standard deviations away from the average of samples.  The second method, Variance, will remove any sample that is X% more than the Variance average.  The Variance method takes into account a certain number of 'outliers'.  Those are exceptional samples, like the spike, that need to be excluded from the Variance Average calculation."
msgstr "Waxaa jira laba hab oo ka-saaris ah. Midda koowaad, Standard Deviation (Leexashada Caadiga ah), waxay ka saari doontaa muunad kasta oo X tiro ah oo leexasho caadi ah ka fog celceliska muunadaha. Habka labaad, Variance (Kala-duwanaanshaha), wuxuu ka saari doonaa muunad kasta oo X% ka badan celceliska Variance. Habka Variance wuxuu tixgeliyaa tiro cayiman oo ah 'muunadaha ka baxsan xadka' (outliers). Kuwaasi waa muunado gaar ah, sida kororka degdegga ah (spike), oo u baahan in laga reebo xisaabinta Celceliska Variance."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Standard Deviation"
msgstr "Leexashada Caadiga ah"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Based w/Outliers Removed"
msgstr "Ku Saleysan Variance iyadoo la Saaray Muunadaha Ka Baxsan Xadka"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Replacement Method"
msgstr "Habka Beddelka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are three replacement methods.  The first method replaces the spike with the average of the data source in question.  The second method replaces the spike with a 'NaN'.  The last replaces the spike with the last known good value found."
msgstr "Waxaa jira saddex hab oo beddelaad ah. Habka koowaad wuxuu kor u kaca degdegga ah ku beddelaa celceliska isha xogta ee la xiriirta. Habka labaad wuxuu kor u kaca degdegga ah ku beddelaa 'NaN'. Kan u dambeeya wuxuu kor u kaca degdegga ah ku beddelaa qiimihii ugu dambeeyay ee wanaagsanaa ee la helay."

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Average"
msgstr "Celcelis"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "NaN's"
msgstr "NaN-yada"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Last Known Good"
msgstr "Kii Ugu Dambeeyay ee Wanaagsanaa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Standard Deviations"
msgstr "Tirada Leexashooyinka Halbeegga ah"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Any value that is this many standard deviations above the average will be excluded.  A good number will be dependent on the type of data to be operated on.  We recommend a number no lower than 5 Standard Deviations."
msgstr "Qiime kasta oo intaas oo leexasho halbeeg ah ka sarreeya celceliska waa laga saarayaa. Tiro wanaagsan waxay ku xirnaan doontaa nooca xogta lagu shaqeynayo. Waxaan ku talinaynaa tiro aan ka yarayn 5 Leexasho Halbeeg ah."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Standard Deviations"
msgstr "%d Leexasho Halbeeg ah"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Percentage"
msgstr "Boqolkiiba Variance"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "This value represents the percentage above the adjusted sample average once outliers have been removed from the sample.  For example, a Variance Percentage of 100%% on an adjusted average of 50 would remove any sample above the quantity of 100 from the graph."
msgstr "Qiimahani wuxuu matalayaa boqolkiiba ka sarreeya celceliska muunadda la habeeyay marka laga saaro muunadaha ka baxsan xadka muunadda. Tusaale ahaan, Boqolkiiba Variance oo ah 100%% oo saaran celcelis la habeeyay oo ah 50 wuxuu garaafka ka saari doonaa muunad kasta oo ka sarreysa tirada 100."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Number of Outliers"
msgstr "Tirada Qiimayaasha Ka-baxsan ee Kala-duwanaanshaha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the number of high and low average samples will be removed from the sample set prior to calculating the Variance Average.  If you choose an outlier value of 5, then both the top and bottom 5 averages are removed."
msgstr "Qiimahani wuxuu matalayaa tirada muunadaha celceliska sare iyo kuwa hoose ee laga saari doono kooxda muunadda ka hor inta aan la xisaabin Celceliska Kala-duwanaanshaha. Haddii aad doorato qiime ka-baxsan oo ah 5, markaa labada 5 celcelis ee ugu sarreeya iyo kuwa ugu hooseeya waa la saarayaa."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d High/Low Samples"
msgstr "%d Muunado Sare/Hoose"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Max Kills Per RRA"
msgstr "Ka Saarista Ugu Badan ee RRA Kasta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the maximum number of spikes to remove from a Graph RRA."
