#: user_domains.php
msgid "Mode which cacti will attempt to authenticate against the LDAP server.<blockquote><i>No Searching</i> - No Distinguished Name (DN) searching occurs, just attempt to bind with the provided Distinguished Name (DN) format.<br><br><i>Anonymous Searching</i> - Attempts to search for username against LDAP directory via anonymous binding to locate the users Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>Specific Searching</i> - Attempts search for username against LDAP directory via Specific Distinguished Name (DN) and Specific Password for binding to locate the users Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>One-Time Passwords (OTP/MFA)</i> - Cacti binds the user's password only once, during final authentication.  <i>No Searching</i> performs no directory lookup and binds directly using the Distinguished Name (DN) template, so it is safe for OTP when the DN template alone identifies the user.  When a directory lookup is required to resolve the DN, use <i>Specific Searching</i> with a dedicated service account (or <i>Anonymous Searching</i> where the directory permits it) so the lookup never consumes the user's single-use code.  For resilient OTP deployments use a single DNS load balancer name in the Server(s) field rather than a space delimited multi-server list, which would re-attempt the bind with an already-consumed one-time password."
msgstr "Habka uu Cacti isku dayayo inuu ku xaqiijiyo aqoonsiga adeegaha LDAP.<blockquote><i>Raadin La'aan</i> - Ma jirto raadin Magaca La Soocay (DN) ah oo dhacda, kaliya isku day in lagu xiro qaabka Magaca La Soocay (DN) ee la bixiyay.<br><br><i>Raadin Qarsoodi ah</i> - Waxay isku daydaa inay ka raadiso magaca isticmaalaha diiwaanka LDAP iyadoo loo marayo xirid qarsoodi ah si loo helo Magaca La Soocay (DN) ee isticmaalaha.<br><br><i>Raadin Gaar ah</i> - Waxay isku daydaa inay ka raadiso magaca isticmaalaha diiwaanka LDAP iyadoo loo marayo Magac La Soocay (DN) oo Gaar ah iyo Fure Sireed Gaar ah oo lagu xiro si loo helo Magaca La Soocay (DN) ee isticmaalaha.<br><br><i>Furayaasha Sirta ah ee Hal-Mar ah (OTP/MFA)</i> - Cacti waxay xirtaa furaha sirta ah ee isticmaalaha hal mar oo keliya, inta lagu jiro xaqiijinta kama dambaysta ah.  <i>Raadin La'aan</i> ma samayso wax raadin diiwaan ah waxayna si toos ah ugu xirtaa iyadoo adeegsanaysa qaab-dhismeedka Magaca La Soocay (DN), sidaas darteed way u badbaado qabtaa OTP marka qaab-dhismeedka DN keliya uu aqoonsado isticmaalaha.  Marka loo baahdo raadin diiwaan si loo xalliyo DN, isticmaal <i>Raadin Gaar ah</i> oo leh akoon adeeg oo u go'an (ama <i>Raadin Qarsoodi ah</i> halka uu diiwaanku oggol yahay) si aanay raadintu waligeed u isticmaalin koodhka hal-mar la adeegsado ee isticmaalaha.  Hirgelinta adkaysiga leh ee OTP, ku isticmaal hal magac oo DNS ah oo dheellitiraha culayska gudaha goobta Server(s) halkii aad ka isticmaali lahayd liis adeegayaal badan oo meel bannaan lagu kala soocay, taas oo mar kale isku dayi lahayd xiridda iyadoo leh fure hal-mar ah oo horay loo isticmaalay."

#: user_domains.php
msgid "Search base for searching the LDAP directory, such as <i>\"dc=win2kdomain,dc=local\"</i> or <i>\"ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>."
msgstr "Saldhigga raadinta ee laga baarayo buugga LDAP, sida <i>\"dc=win2kdomain,dc=local\"</i> ama <i>\"ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>."

#: user_domains.php
msgid "Search filter to use to locate the user in the LDAP directory, such as for windows: <i>\"(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))\"</i> or for OpenLDAP: <i>\"(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))\"</i>.  \"&lt;username&gt\" is replaced with the username that was supplied at the login prompt."
msgstr "Shaandhada raadinta ee loo adeegsado in laga helo isticmaalaha diiwaanka LDAP, sida Windows: <i>\"(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))\"</i> ama OpenLDAP: <i>\"(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))\"</i>. \"&lt;username&gt\" waxaa lagu beddelaa magaca isticmaalaha ee lagu qoray meesha gelitaanka."

