#: utilities.php
msgid "Cacti technical support page.  Used by developers and technical support persons to assist with issues in Cacti.  Includes checks for common configuration issues."
msgstr "Bogga taageerada farsamo ee Cacti. Waxaa adeegsada horumariyeyaasha iyo shaqaalaha taageerada farsamo si ay uga caawiyaan dhibaatooyinka ka jira Cacti. Waxaa ku jira hubinta dhibaatooyinka qaabeynta caadiga ah."

#: utilities.php
msgid "The Cacti Log stores statistic, error and other message depending on system settings.  This information can be used to identify problems with the poller and application."
msgstr "Diiwaanka Cacti wuxuu kaydiyaa tirakoobka, khaladaadka iyo farriimaha kale iyadoo ku xiran dejinta nidaamka. Macluumaadkan waxaa loo isticmaali karaa in lagu aqoonsado dhibaatooyinka poller-ka iyo barnaamijka."

#: utilities.php
msgid "Allows Administrators to browse the user log.  Administrators can filter and export the log as well."
msgstr "Wuxuu u oggolaadaa Maamulayaasha inay baaraan diiwaanka isticmaalaha. Maamulayaashu waxay sidoo kale shaandheyn karaan oo dhoofin karaan diiwaanka."

#: utilities.php
msgid "Poller Cache Administration"
msgstr "Maamulka Kaydka Poller-ka"

#: utilities.php
msgid "This is the data that is being passed to the poller each time it runs. This data is then in turn executed/interpreted and the results are fed into the RRDfiles for graphing or the database for display."
msgstr "Tani waa xogta loo gudbiyo poller-ka mar kasta oo uu shaqeeyo. Xogtan waxaa markaa la fuliyaa/fasiraa natiijooyinkana waxaa lagu shubaa faylasha RRD si loogu sawiro garaafyada ama kaydka xogta si loo muujiyo."

#: utilities.php
msgid "The Data Query Cache stores information gathered from Data Query input types. The values from these fields can be used in the text area of Graphs for Legends, Vertical Labels, and GPRINTS as well as in CDEF's."
msgstr "Kaydka Weydiinta Xogta wuxuu kaydiyaa macluumaadka laga soo ururiyay noocyada gelinta Weydiinta Xogta. Qiimayaasha goobahan waxaa loo isticmaali karaa aagga qoraalka ee Garaafyada ee Sharaxaadda, Summadaha Toosan, iyo GPRINT sidoo kale CDEF."

#: utilities.php
msgid "Rebuild Poller Cache"
msgstr "Dib u Dhis Kaydka Poller-ka"

#: utilities.php
msgid "The Poller Cache will be re-generated if you select this option. Use this option only in the event of a database crash if you are experiencing issues after the crash and have already run the database repair tools.  Alternatively, if you are having problems with a specific Device, simply re-save that Device to rebuild its Poller Cache.  There is also a command line interface equivalent to this command that is recommended for large systems."
msgstr "Kaydka Poller-ka dib ayaa loo abuuri doonaa haddii aad doorato ikhtiyaarkan. Isticmaal ikhtiyaarkan oo keliya haddii kaydka xogta uu burburo oo aad la kulanto dhibaatooyin burburka kaddib isla markaana aad horay u socodsiisay qalabka hagaajinta kaydka xogta. Haddii kale, haddii aad dhibaato kala kulmeyso Qalab gaar ah, si fudud dib ugu kaydi Qalabkaas si dib loogu dhiso Kaydkiisa Poller-ka. Waxaa sidoo kale jira isdhexgal khadka taliska ah oo u dhigma amarkan kaas oo lagula talinayo nidaamyada waaweyn."

#: utilities.php
msgid "NOTE: On large systems, this command may take several minutes to hours to complete and therefore should not be run from the Cacti UI.  You can simply run 'php -q cli/rebuild_poller_cache.php --help' at the command line for more information."
msgstr "FIIRO GAAR AH: Nidaamyada waaweyn, amarkan wuxuu qaadan karaa dhowr daqiiqo ilaa saacado si uu u dhammaystiro sidaas darteedna waa in aan laga socodsiin isdhexgalka Cacti. Waxaad si fudud uga socodsiin kartaa 'php -q cli/rebuild_poller_cache.php --help' khadka taliska si aad u hesho macluumaad dheeraad ah."

#: utilities.php
msgid "Rebuild Resource Cache"
msgstr "Dib u Dhis Kaydka Kheyraadka"

#: utilities.php
msgid "When operating multiple Data Collectors in Cacti, Cacti will attempt to maintain state for key files on all Data Collectors.  This includes all core, non-install related website and plugin files.  When you force a Resource Cache rebuild, Cacti will clear the local Resource Cache, and then rebuild it at the next scheduled poller start.  This will trigger all Remote Data Collectors to recheck their website and plugin files for consistency."
msgstr "Marka laga shaqeynayo Ururiyeyaal Xog badan oo ku jira Cacti, Cacti wuxuu isku dayi doonaa inuu ilaaliyo xaaladda faylasha muhiimka ah ee dhammaan Ururiyeyaasha Xogta. Tan waxaa ku jira dhammaan faylasha aasaasiga ah ee mareegaha iyo kuwa kordhinta ee aan la xiriirin rakibaadda. Marka aad khasabto dib-u-dhisidda Kaydka Kheyraadka, Cacti wuxuu nadiifin doonaa Kaydka Kheyraadka ee maxalliga ah, kaddibna dib ayuu u dhisi doonaa bilowga xiga ee poller-ka loo qorsheeyay. Tani waxay ku kicin doontaa dhammaan Ururiyeyaasha Xogta ee Fog inay dib u hubiyaan faylashooda mareegaha iyo kuwa kordhinta si ay isku waafaqaan."

